00:51:42.699 --> 00:51:45.569
MEN OR WHITE WOMEN. THEY ARE IN

00:51:45.635 --> 00:51:48.939
FACT NEEDING PROTECTION OF BOTH

00:51:49.005 --> 00:51:52.309
ASPECTS OF THEIR IDENTITY AS A

00:51:52.375 --> 00:51:55.378
WOMAN, AS AS AN ASIAN PERSON.

00:51:55.445 --> 00:51:56.379
