00:51:59.282 --> 00:52:02.152
LAWS HERE IN CALIFORNIA FAIL TO

00:52:02.219 --> 00:52:02.652
EXPLICITLY RECOGNIZE THE

00:52:02.719 --> 00:52:05.822
